# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Re-included on purpose. These rules come last so they override the broad
# patterns above (in .gitignore the LAST matching rule wins).
#
# split_ml32m/ holds the 80/10/10 split: the train/valid/test CSVs are derived
# MovieLens data and stay out, but the RecBole configs and the small result
# metrics are needed to interpret the reported numbers.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
split_ml32m/*
!split_ml32m/recbole_general.yaml
!split_ml32m/recbole_sequential.yaml
!split_ml32m/split_info.json
!split_ml32m/comparison.csv
!split_ml32m/results/
split_ml32m/results/*
!split_ml32m/results/*.json
!split_ml32m/results/*.npz
